# Preserve existing design

Do **not** change the existing UI/UX theme, design, colors, fonts, or layout.
All fixes must respect the current design system exactly as it is.
Do not introduce new UI patterns, component styles, or visual changes.
Only fix the functional bug/logic — keep the existing look and feel identical.
Work within the existing theme, not your own interpretation.

- Reuse existing tokens, classes, and components (`admin-tokens.css`, DC tokens, storefront CSS).
- No new palettes, font stacks, spacing scales, card skins, or layout rewrites on a bugfix.
- Visual change only when the owner **explicitly** asks to change design/UI.

```
❌ Restyle a broken page “while you’re there”
✅ Fix the logic and leave markup/CSS as-is
```
